&lt;div class="content-intro"&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="auto"&gt;About THG&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:279}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="auto"&gt;We are THG, a global ecommerce group on a mission to be the global online leader in beauty and sports nutrition.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:279}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="auto"&gt;Our portfolio of&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="auto"&gt; leading retailers and brands such as LOOKFANTASTIC, Myprotein, ESPA, Perricone MD, and Cult Beauty form our two core businesses: THG Beauty and THG Nutrition.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:279}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="none"&gt;From Manchester to New York, we’re powered by a team of over 2500 people who work together, lead by example, and think BIG.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="none"&gt;With us, you’ll go further, faster. What are you waiting for?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:279}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;THG Nutrition&lt;/strong&gt;:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class="ui-provider a b c d e f g h i j k l m n o p q r s t u v w x y z ab ac ae af ag ah ai aj ak"&gt;THG Nutrition is home to some of the best loved and most trusted names in wellbeing and nutrition, including Myprotein, the world's largest online sports nutrition brand, its family of brands, Myvegan, Myvitamins and MP Activewear.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We want to be the world's most empowering health movement, championing everyone to live healthier, more active lives. Our brands and people exist to break boundaries, to power and empower those who want more.&amp;nbsp;Everything we do is done in-house, from manufacturing and new product development to content creation, e-commerce, marketing and logistics. This means we’re perfectly positioned to deliver to our vision and keep our place at the top of a fast-moving, global industry.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;It's an incredibly exciting time to join the team, and we’re always looking for talented people who share our vision and values to drive our Nutrition &amp;amp; Wellness movement forward.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role: Paid Social Manager (Clothing)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Area / Brand: Paid Media / Clothing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reporting to: Head of Paid Media&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="none"&gt;About the role&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class="isSelectedEnd"&gt;A&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;he Role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p class="isSelectedEnd"&gt;As Paid Social Manager, you'll take ownership of the strategy, execution and optimisation of our paid social activity across platforms including &lt;strong&gt;Meta, TikTok and other relevant social channels&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class="isSelectedEnd"&gt;You'll be a commercially minded performance marketer who understands how to combine compelling creative with data-led optimisation to drive growth. You'll work closely with our Creative, Brand, E-commerce and wider Marketing teams to develop campaigns that deliver both short-term performance and long-term brand growth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class="isSelectedEnd"&gt;This is a hands-on role with significant ownership and the opportunity to make a measurable impact on the continued growth of MP Activewear.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul data-spread="false"&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own and execute the paid social strategy across key platforms, primarily Meta and TikTok.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage significant paid social budgets, ensuring investment is aligned with commercial objectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Plan, launch and optimise campaigns across the full customer journey, from acquisition through to conversion and retention.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Continuously optimise campaigns to improve ROAS, CPA, CAC, conversion rate and customer value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and manage structured testing programmes across creative, audiences, messaging, formats and placements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with the Creative team to develop high-performing, performance-led advertising concepts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use campaign and customer data to identify opportunities, trends and areas for growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyse creative performance and translate insights into actionable recommendations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay ahead of changes across Meta, TikTok and the wider paid social landscape.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor competitor activity and emerging trends to identify new opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own regular paid social reporting, communicating performance, insights and recommendations to key stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with E-commerce, CRM, Brand and wider Marketing teams to ensure paid social activity supports broader business objectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the testing and launch of new social platforms, formats and opportunities as the business evolves.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;About You&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p class="isSelectedEnd"&gt;We're looking for someone who is &lt;strong&gt;commercially driven, creative-minded and highly analytical&lt;/strong&gt;, with a genuine passion for paid social and digital marketing.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class="isSelectedEnd"&gt;You'll ideally have:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-spread="false"&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience managing paid social campaigns, particularly across &lt;strong&gt;Meta and TikTok&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing significant paid social budgets with clear responsibility for performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong knowledge of paid social strategy, campaign structures, targeting, bidding and optimisation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong understanding of performance metrics including ROAS, CPA, CAC, CTR, CPM, CVR and LTV.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience developing and implementing structured creative testing strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong understanding of how creative impacts paid social performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to interpret data, identify trends and turn insights into clear actions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working closely with creative teams to produce and scale winning advertising.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong commercial awareness and an understanding of the wider e-commerce customer journey.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication and stakeholder management skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A proactive, entrepreneurial approach and the confidence to test, learn and challenge the status quo.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience within fashion, activewear, fitness, beauty or another consumer/e-commerce brand would be advantageous.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class="isSelectedEnd"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="auto"&gt;What’s in it for me?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="auto"&gt;Career Development&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="auto"&gt;Access bespoke development programmes that have been designed and developed by our in-house L&amp;amp;D team.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="auto"&gt;Develop your expertise through our upskilling programme that is delivered in partnership with an industry-leading training provider.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="auto"&gt;Enhanced Leave&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="auto"&gt;25 days annual leave plus bank holidays.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="auto"&gt;Don’t want to work on your birthday? We don’t either! Enjoy your day off on us!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="auto"&gt;Enhanced maternity and paternity pay, depending on length of service.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="auto"&gt;Up to 10 days compassionate leave.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="auto"&gt;Buy back up to 3 days each year.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="auto"&gt;Unlock 2 days volunteer leave after 12-months.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="auto"&gt;Wellbeing Support&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="auto"&gt;Access face-to-face and virtual appointments with our in-house GP.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="auto"&gt;Access our 24/7 Employee Assistance Programme (EAP) which is provided by Bupa.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="auto"&gt;State-of-the-art on-site gym.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="auto"&gt;Access to our on-site physio.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="auto"&gt;Other Perks&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="auto"&gt;Save up to 12% on the cost of personal tech through our salary sacrifice scheme.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="auto"&gt;Subsidised bus pass from Manchester City Centre to our ICON office.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="auto"&gt;Up to 50% staff discount on THG brands.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="auto"&gt;On-site staff shop.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="auto"&gt;Know someone who would be perfect for THG? Refer them and get up to £1000 when they pass their probation.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="auto"&gt;Anniversary gifts when you hit 5 and 10 years of service.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class="content-conclusion"&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;THG is proud to be a Disability Confident Committed employer. If you are invited to interview, please let us know if there are any reasonable adjustments we can make to the recruitment process that will enable you to perform to the best of your ability.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;THG is committed to creating a diverse &amp;amp; inclusive environment and hence welcomes applications from all sections of the community.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Because of the high volumes of applications our opportunities attract, it sometimes takes us time to review and consider them all. We endeavour to respond to every application we receive within 14 days. If you haven't heard from us within that time frame or should you have any specific questions about this or other applications for positions at THG please contact one of our &lt;span class="mark75xs2u5gf" data-markjs="true" data-ogac="" data-ogab="" data-ogsc="" data-ogsb=""&gt;Talent&lt;/span&gt; team to discuss further.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</p>

arbeitnow:senior-fullstack-engineer-cust:
&lt;div class="content-intro"&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Staffbase&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We inspire people to achieve great things together. Our mission is to help organizations unlock the power of inspirational communication with the first &lt;strong&gt;AI-native Employee Experience Platform&lt;/strong&gt;. Our&lt;strong&gt; industry-leading and award-winning agentic AI communications channels&lt;/strong&gt; - intranet, employee app and email solutions - create engaging experiences that connect and empower employees.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Headquartered in Chemnitz, Germany and New York City, with offices in Berlin, London, Sydney, Tokyo, Prague, and Minneapolis–St. Paul, our diverse team of 550+ employees supports 1,500+ customers—reaching over 14 million employees—in transforming their employee experience.&lt;br&gt;We are proud to be a&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-stringify-type="bold"&gt;Unicorn&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;company—privately valued at over $1 billion—demonstrating strong growth, innovation, and lasting impact in our industry. Together, we’re shaping the future of workplace communication.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;"&gt;We’re looking for an experienced Senior Fullstack Engineer to join a newly formed team at Staffbase that builds custom solutions — extending the functionality and capabilities of our award-winning employee communications platform to meet real customer needs. You’ll own solutions from beginning to end: shaping use cases together with stakeholders, building them across the stack, and validating them with the people who use them. You’ll also help bring structure to a growing team of mid-level engineers and mentor them along the way. We’re looking for empathetic, motivated team players who are driven by ownership and growth. Let’s talk!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;As part of our tech stack, we use: &lt;/strong&gt;React.js, TypeScript, JavaScript, Node.js, Kotlin, Go, Java, MongoDB, REST APIs &amp;amp; SDKs, Docker, Terraform, Selenium and Cypress, to name a few.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our environment&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;"&gt;Working with skilled and like-minded professionals in a team that values diversity and inclusivity&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;"&gt;We aim to create a flexible and agile work environment that promotes the well-being and work-life balance of our employees&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;"&gt;We believe that team events during working hours play a vital role in building an exceptionally effective team, and we encourage them&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;"&gt;We are enthusiastic about technology and committed to using it to improve the world&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;"&gt;We follow the “You build it, you run it” approach and take pride in it&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;"&gt;You’ll join a newly formed team dedicated to building custom solutions that extend the Staffbase platform for our enterprise customers. We turn specific customer needs into reliable, scalable extensions — widgets, plugins, and integrations — that make our product work exactly the way each customer needs it to.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;"&gt;Because the team is new, there’s real room to shape how we work: to set engineering standards, bring structure to our processes, and grow together. That’s where you come in.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll be doing&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;"&gt;Own the development of custom solutions end-to-end — from technical design through implementation, testing, and release&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;"&gt;Partner with stakeholders (customers, consultants, and internal teams) to define and detail use cases before development, then validate solutions and gather feedback afterward&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;"&gt;Build across the stack: customer-facing UI in React and TypeScript, backend services, and integrations with Staffbase and third-party APIs&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;"&gt;Mentor mid-level engineers and help bring structure, engineering standards, and good practices to a newly formed team&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;"&gt;Work in a cross-functional, agile setup and produce high-quality, well-tested code&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;"&gt;Give and receive valuable feedback in our code review process, and continuously learn and share knowledge with your peers&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;"&gt;Work iteratively — pushing code frequently, keeping a healthy CI/CD pipeline, and automating where it helps&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you need to be successful&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;"&gt;Solid professional experience (typically 5+ years) as a fullstack developer, including working within engineering teams and owning solutions from concept to delivery&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;"&gt;Strong frontend skills with React.js, TypeScript, and JavaScript, paired with solid backend experience (e.g. Kotlin, Java, or Node.js)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;"&gt;Confidence working with REST APIs and SDKs, and integrating with external systems&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;"&gt;Experience mentoring or guiding less-experienced developers, and a knack for bringing structure to how a team works&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;"&gt;Comfort working directly with stakeholders — you can translate business needs into technical solutions and validate them afterward&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;"&gt;A strong focus on quality, clean code, testing, and continuous learning&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;"&gt;Fluent written and spoken English and German — both are required, as you’ll work closely with German-speaking stakeholders and customers in the region&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;"&gt;A self-starter who works well both independently and as part of a team&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;"&gt;You understand and appreciate diversity and inclusivity in the workplace&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;"&gt;Experience with Go, MongoDB, Docker, Kubernetes, GitHub Actions, Terraform, Prometheus or Grafana&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;"&gt;A background in professional services, consulting, or building custom, customer-facing solutions&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;"&gt;Enterprise integration concepts such as SSO, SAML, OIDC, or SCIM&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;"&gt;A good understanding of REST and microservices architecture&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you'll get&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;"&gt;&lt;em&gt;Competitive Compensation&lt;/em&gt; - we offer attractive salary packages including LTIP (unit-based Long Term Incentive Plan)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 14pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;"&gt;&lt;em&gt;Flexibility &lt;/em&gt;- we offer flexible working time models and the option of hybrid work, and support this with a yearly flex work allowance of €1560&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;"&gt;&lt;em&gt;Recharge&lt;/em&gt; - with 31 vacation days annually (incl. one floating holiday), plus pro rata fully paid Fridays off during August&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 14pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;"&gt;&lt;em&gt;Support&lt;/em&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;-&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;we offer offering a company pension scheme&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 14pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;"&gt;&lt;em&gt;Volunteers Day&lt;/em&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;- you’ll get one day off per year for supporting a social project&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class="content-conclusion"&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;img src="https://imgur.com/a/kIbq0q5" alt="" style="max-width: 100%;"&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</p>

